  "title": "YourNest Venture Capital",
  "text": "YourNest Venture Capital\n\n\nYourNest Venture Capital is a sharply focused, early-stage VC firm. Currently deploying its 4th fund (INR 1500 Crore) to invest in startups with a focus on innovative, tech-led products and a vision to nurture global market leaders from India, we are focused on disruptive technologies to enhance how mankind leverages the value of time. \n\n\nWe are a growing team of passionate professionals who are strong thought leaders and natural team players, enjoying reimagining the future and crafting global solutions. And we do not believe that age, gender, ethnicity or physical differences define one's potential. We believe in nurturing talent and enjoy an open-door, all-time-access culture. \n\n\nOur portfolio companies are at the forefront of innovation and are always looking for talented individuals to join their teams. If you are passionate about technology and committed to the startup ecosystem, you’ve come to the right place. Our startups offer a range of open positions to drive your career. We encourage candidates with a strong entrepreneurial spirit and a desire to make a difference to apply and join something truly extraordinary. We look forward to welcoming new talent to YourNest and our portfolio companies – a dynamic set of ‘Challengineer’ founders whose ambitions we actively support.\nContact info:\nopenings@yournest.in\nhttps://yournest.in/\n416, 4th Floor, MGF Metropolis (Lifestyle) Mall Metro Station, near, Mehrauli-Gurgaon Rd, Gurugram, Haryana 122002\nCareers at YourNest Venture Capital\n​\n​\nDepartment\nSelect departments\nLocation\nSelect locations\nHiring Powered By\nPyjamaHR",
